{"version":1,"content":"<p>前日本AV女優濱崎真緒日前在尖沙咀疑遭落藥迷暈，現已正式復工，當中佢有份拍攝嘅HOY劇集《你的保安李寶安》中，貢獻出爆笑與火辣畫面，同麥沛東（麥東）與盧頌恩（妹頭）等對戲。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:43:53.560646+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T02:21:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:37:15.939488+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:37:15.939488+00:00","content_hash":"287957362ba82a2952c3590e76429967fa40e8e79edf8f5f4906456d2603bfbc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}